{
 "encounter_id": "00639",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, it's the shoulder. I can't lift my arm above my head any more, I was trying to reach the press and, ah, I just couldn't."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which side, and how long?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The right. Three weeks now, give or take."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it hurt or is it just stuck?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both, sure. There's a sort of, an ache at night, mostly, when I lie on it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything when you move it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "There's a clicking. Started... I'm not sure when. Before the weakness, I think? Or maybe along with it. I couldn't tell you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Any fall or knock to it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no fall. I didn't hurt it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Neck pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really, no. The neck's grand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness or pins and needles down the arm?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever or feeling unwell with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm well in myself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medicines. What are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ramipril for the pressure, 5 mg, once a day. Atorvastatin, 20 mg, at night. And paracetamol, 1 gram, up to four times a day, for the shoulder."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Are you allergic to anything, any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah. Maybe. I think I came out in a rash, years ago, after one of the antibiotics. But I couldn't tell you which one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll record that as unconfirmed. Health history, apart from the shoulder?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, high cholesterol, the gout, and the arthritis in my knees."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A knee replacement, the left one, about six years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart or joint problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had a heart attack at sixty. And my sister has rheumatoid arthritis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I gave up smoking in 2015."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass of wine at the weekend, I'd say. Sure, that's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at it. Pulse 74, blood pressure 142 over 86, temperature 36.5, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, weight 91 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pressure all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A touch up from the pain, I'd say. Now lift your arm out to the side for me.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's as high as it goes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, I can see you can only lift the arm to shoulder height. And there's tenderness at the front of the right shoulder."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, that's sore. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your chest, breathlessness on exertion?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that, my chest is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. This looks most like a rotator cuff problem, the tendons that lift the arm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it a tear? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Could be partial, which is why I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the shoulder and an ultrasound scan of the shoulder."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Grand. Will that be today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The ultrasound is booked by reception. I'd also like to do a blood test for inflammation."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine so. What about the pain at night? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep taking the paracetamol, and try a pillow under the arm when you lie down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks, so. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
